the State is a set.
this's V is a number.

the Game is an actor.
this can Tick.
this's Tick does...
    lock State...
        State's V is 1.
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

State's V is 0.

start Game's Tick as T...
    when T is ok?
        log "tick".
    or when T is canceled?
        log "canceled".
